anizing and with all  due deliberation uh the multi-agency  effort  in the government combined with the  multi-company  effort from all the pharmaceutical  companies  and so this is  not only covering vaccines but  therapeutics and diagnostics  the vaccine group has both components of  vaccine development  supply and manufacturing and also a big  work on delivery and administration  and just to show you how the government  approached this problem the prior  systems including the hiv vaccine trials  network  hiv vaccine preventions network  and the old vtu and now the new idcrc  and even dod sites combined into a  consortium of government sites now  called coronavirus  prevention network that covers  much of the country is shown here in  these  red dots and when you combine that with  the  company's cro  sites that are contract sites you can  cover virtually  the entire country and in the case of  moderna there's 99  sites activated to enroll this trial  there's a website now for the network if  you're interested in finding  out more about it  coronaviruspreventionnetwork.org  and there's a big effort through  dod and others that  and uh hhs uh putting predictive  analytics and  really uh amazing modeling and  and computer power behind this to try to  anticipate  how the outbreak is moving by using  county maps of prevalence and new cases  and overlaying that with the testing  sites  and places like meat packing plate  companies who  have known to have uh major outbreaks  and and now colleges etc so  these kinds of approaches will help um  a shift uh emphasis on enrollment to try  to capture  cases in the phase 3 trial so i'll  summarize here  by just restating that  this is all made possible the rapid  development was made possible by prior  fundamental basic and translational  research  this idea of combining precision  vaccinology and platform manufacturing  for both  precision and speed  proactive planning toward  [Music]  virus families that may have a  proclivi